Name: Generic Bootloader Library (GBL)
URL: https://android.googlesource.com/platform/bootable/libbootloader/
Revision: 368d48c224d7b8697e3a276e7a054ad6863d1655
Security Critical: yes

License: Apache-2.0
License File: LICENSE

Description:
  Use repo to download the source using the Android
  [uefi-gbl-mainline manifest](https://android.googlesource.com/kernel/manifest/+/refs/heads/uefi-gbl-mainline/default.xml):

  ```sh
  # You can choose a different directory name if you prefer.
  mkdir gbl
  cd gbl

  repo init -u https://android.googlesource.com/kernel/manifest -b uefi-gbl-mainline
  repo sync -j$(nproc)
  ```

Local Modifications:
  * The paths of headers that provide definitions for common Efi
    types and standard integers are modified to compile under Fuchsia.
